tem_assets/steam/apps/3908090/extras/8e141db507f747bc3fd750d0c0706620.webm?t=1761668841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908090/extras/8e141db507f747bc3fd750d0c0706620.mp4?t=1761668841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908090/extras/93f79ce7d9864b17dbd208ff6b76de9d.avif?t=1761668841\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908090/extras_big/93f79ce7d9864b17dbd208ff6b76de9d.webp?t=1761668841 width=1560 height=93 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visuals &amp; Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Operation Stutter\u2019s world is steeped in Cold War aesthetics and brutalist architecture, brought to life with the visual language of arthouse cinema inspired by the meticulous framing of Stanley Kubrick. Every environment feels alive \u2014 from concrete-clad corridors to flooded chambers, from sterile research labs to oppressive underground shelters. The interplay of light, shadow, and color creates a cinematic unease that reflects the story\u2019s themes of paranoia and isolation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908090/extras/c3b59baa527c3949baad7ad318693455.poster.avif?t=1761668841\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908090/extras/c3b59baa527c3949baad7ad318693455.webm?t=1761668841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908090/extras/c3b59baa527c3949baad7ad318693455.mp4?t=1761668841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908090/extras/d6d8b5c787013dc2f0212bd9283fb19f.avif?t=1761668841\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908090/extras_big/d6d8b5c787013dc2f0212bd9283fb19f.webp?t=1761668841 width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Experience</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a layered, surreal story where reality fractures under pressure. Explore themes of memory, identity, and Cold War paranoia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror Through Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Experience an unsettling world where reality bends subtly, evoking dread through disorientation and tension rather than jump scares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clues and Discovery</strong> \u2013 Take photos with your film camera. Collect scattered notes, audio tapes, polaroids, photographs and documents to piece together the fragmented past of the protagonist and uncover the secrets of a top-secret operation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Visuals</strong> \u2013 Inspired by arthouse cinema, with intentional filmic cinematography and visual symbolism.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Cold War Aesthetic</strong> \u2013 Inspired by 1980s surveillance culture and analog tech, film cameras, CRT monitors, magnetic tapes, bunker walls, propaganda posters and nuclear dread set the tone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Sound Design</strong> \u2013 An unsettling soundscape, layered with analog noise, Cold War broadcasts, and dynamic music heightens immersion and tension.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908090/extras/713a6029620cafbbc5afa24db1eccaa2.avif?t=1761668841\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908090/extras_big/713a6029620cafbbc5afa24db1eccaa2.webp?t=1761668841 width=1560 height=170 /></span></p>","developers":["Kevir Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908090/d8db1260d980551b541dbb25d9d044a703b5a093/header.jpg?t=1761668841","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3908090/1839955716/3d0597031f54f45c0c4b38928024c9b69bb522b9/1755421524/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755807650","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3908090/1839955716/3d0597031f54f45c0c4b38928024c9b69bb522b9/1755421524/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755807650","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3908090/1839955716/3d0597031f54f45c0c4b38928024c9b69bb522b9/1755421524/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755807650","id":257184339,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184339/movie480.mp4?t=1755807650","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184339/movie_max.mp4?t=1755807650"},"name":"Operation Stutter - Official Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257184339/e869b4204cdc9ef87ede37c74fa2a83d08640655/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755807650","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184339/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755807650","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184339/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755807650"}}],"name":"Operation Stutter","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10/11 64 bits<br></l